<title>MEXICO: Sky Entertainment DTH TV launched in Mexico.</title>
<headline>Sky Entertainment DTH TV launched in Mexico.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sky Entertainment Services, the direct-to-home satellite television service, began offering its product in Mexico on Wednesday, officials said.</p>
<p>Sky is a joint venture between Rupert Murdoch's News Corp, Mexico's Grupo Televisa, Brazil's Globo and U.S. cable giant TCI Communications Inc..</p>
<p>Sky will compete with DirecTV International, a company owned mostly by Hughes Communications Inc.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565</p>
